{
  "description": "Contract cases for the field controller's REST API v1 (controller/atalaia_controller/api.py; the Android controller, app/lib/controller/controller_api.dart, decision PE24). Each case starts a fresh controller (no games, node id 0, a radio that is up, a clock at 0) and runs its steps in order. A 'request' step sends method and path with the token named (gm, read, none: no Authorization header, bad: an unknown token) and the JSON body if given; the answer must have the status and, if given, a body matching 'json'. 'save' keeps values of the answer (dotted paths) under names; '${name}' in a path or as a whole string value stands for a saved value. An 'rx' step is a decrypted packet from a box as the radio gives it (HELLO, STATE: the payload's fields by name, counters by team id; EVENT: the event, encoded by the core's codec, prio from the schema when not given). An 'advance_ms' step moves the controller's clock on and runs its tick once. Matching: an object matches when every key given matches (other keys are free); '$absent' as a value means the key must not be there and '$any' that it must be there; a list matches element by element and must have the same length, except {'$contains': [...]}, where each pattern must match some element. The Python controller is the reference: these cases describe what it does (controller/tests/test_api_contract.py), and the Android controller must do the same (app/test/controller/api_contract_test.dart).",
  "tokens": {"gm": "gm-secret", "read": "read-secret"},
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "tokens: none, unknown, read and GM",
      "steps": [
        {"request": {"method": "GET", "path": "/healthz", "token": "none"}, "status": 200, "json": {"ok": true, "radio": "up"}},
        {"request": {"method": "GET", "path": "/api/v1/games", "token": "none"}, "status": 401, "json": {"detail": "$any"}},
        {"request": {"method": "GET", "path": "/api/v1/games", "token": "bad"}, "status": 401},
        {"request": {"method": "GET", "path": "/api/v1/games", "token": "read"}, "status": 200, "json": []},
        {"request": {"method": "GET", "path": "/api/v1/whoami", "token": "gm"}, "status": 200, "json": {"role": "gm"}},
        {"request": {"method": "GET", "path": "/api/v1/whoami", "token": "read"}, "status": 200, "json": {"role": "read"}},
        {"request": {"method": "POST", "path": "/api/v1/games", "token": "read", "body": {"name": "x", "mode_id": "org.atalaia.domination"}}, "status": 403},
        {"request": {"method": "POST", "path": "/api/v1/games/1/start", "token": "none"}, "status": 401},
        {"request": {"method": "POST", "path": "/api/v1/games/1/start", "token": "read"}, "status": 403},
        {"request": {"method": "GET", "path": "/api/v1/controller", "token": "read"}, "status": 200, "json": {"live_game": null, "role": null, "radio": "up", "node_id": 0}},
        {"request": {"method": "GET", "path": "/api/v1/nodes", "token": "read"}, "status": 200, "json": []}
      ]
    },
